{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1516250-adapting-1st-edition-kiths-to-2nd-edition","id":1516250,"title":"Adapting 1st Edition Kiths to 2nd Edition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-26T13:46:07-07:00","id":1516250,"title":"Adapting 1st Edition Kiths to 2nd Edition","content":"I was wondering if someone could tell me the best way to adapt the Woodwalker as it is from first edition to second edition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-26T15:51:47-07:00","id":1516271,"title":"","content":"Quick and dirty:<br /> <br /> <b>Kith Blessing:</b> When the Woodwalker uses Survival to subsist or navigate by nonmagical means within a wilderness area, achieving three successes counts as an exceptional success.<br /> <i>Wildcraft</i>: The Woodwalker may spend a point of Glamour to perform a Build Equipment action within a wilderness area to create what is necessary to subsist in and protect his territory, using Wits + Survival if a roll is necessary. This may include lasting supplies of safe water and food, secured shelter, means of conveyance, weapons, traps, or even &quot;organizations&quot; consisting of tamed wildlife taught elaborate tricks. He may assemble these things out of whatever is naturally present in the environment, regardless of whether these materials would be adequate for a normal craftsman, even with the proper tools. Woodwalkers are known to cook deadly nightshade into nutritious salads and cleverly weave brittle driftwood and river stones into vault structures with secure locks. Wildcraft can produce working mechanisms of intricately functioning clockwork, though not higher levels of complex machines such as electronics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-27T01:22:56-07:00","id":1516324,"title":"","content":"Thanks, I really appreciate it. As a follow-up I am basing this off of the Waldgeist from German folklore and I was wondering if the Fairest or Wizened Seeming would be more fitting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-27T02:30:16-07:00","id":1516327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darklander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1516250-adapting-1st-edition-kiths-to-2nd-edition?p=1516324#post1516324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks, I really appreciate it. As